        <h1>A <span class="accent">third way</span> of doing science. Since 1969.</h1>
        <p class="brand-hero__sub">CECAM convenes the workshops, schools and conferences that shape computational atomic and molecular science across Europe — anchored at EPFL Lausanne, federated across 21 nodes from Edinburgh to Tel Aviv.</p>
